values ('bacc1010-2022-4000-8000-000000000006', 'kh-grade12-science-mathematics-differential-equations', null, 2022, 'open', 'គេមានសមីការឌីផេរ៉ង់ស្យែល $(E)$៖ $y''+y=2(x+1)e^{-x}$។
